    "note": "The finished design was read from Brian Wichmann’s H153 drawing, its corners snapped to exact values. The drawing gives no steps; we devised the construction.",
    "changes": "The compass steps, their order and the named points are ours. No photograph confirms this design: Wade’s photograph of the panel is taken at an angle, so we built it from Wichmann’s drawing alone. The colours follow the drawing; its dark green is shown in the palette’s teal.",
