      "kind": "drawing",
      "note": "Read from his finished drawing, not construction instructions. His reference is Plate 153 of Claude Humbert, Islamic Ornamental Design: the tile mosaic inside the niches of the arch from the Patio de los Arrayanes into the Sala de la Barca. The construction is ours."
